  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89755af1c0102508b6994151",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且新宇宙说这个建议也是“SETO”，\n重新下定决心，挑战经典三冠。\n首先是──“皋月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bc517e124205b405ba6b7e7a8e554a24a9159eb8be0ef8fe259b75108b8299b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105403.json",
