      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da0c25247f71f0808468a1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使请医生检查，\n也没有发现蛀牙。\n新宇宙说这是“幻肢痛”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49f5dec36f4902352e7fb680e7f359134ae60d4098c44d0159ce4e5de45db701",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c48b5295290964f9a03a5a84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18600720fee23dcad866e024",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她还断言“在菊花赏之前会痊愈”。\n全神贯注地投入夏季集训吧！\n这也是为了克服即将面对的困难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de5e221b52967388fefe012b0472cfac7644e4a6b63a3e8d57816627a2cb240",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d675ff571d8de83aa2bbb08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105406.json",
      "json_path": [
