    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab565c2a62c8a8689a43be1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训──夏天终于到来。\n其他宇宙的命运是在“宝冢纪念”前引退。\n新宇宙暂且避开了这个悲剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68aa576589fb34233258a9adc48b919e1c088b2d07f90bc00bc9c680a26f5a0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105407.json",
      "json_path": [
