    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fa382b2088b4524234d2227",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她想要重新连结在其他宇宙中断的连系，\n并且渐渐扩展……\n全新的梦想将从这里开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a875958bd78c4150e45edd81e9e79e5802d18cba51fcc5ea7c0af665dd762b07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3fc4c13fe874c8b6a3a85b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
