    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e159bd71c73b691e7449dbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原本计划的出道战是草地1800米。\n新宇宙的状态已经完全调整好了。\n但是，她主张应该避开这场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "692a2e107a6021fa520b9e3c8a204308c3b411cd44c65d4bb606b2b6a2362bb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
