      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本德比”当天刮起不合时节的暴风雨！\n再这样下去会像新宇宙所说的，\n无法赶到赛场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9532ba88f1e7be6a6ba0f015b3c14d58b202c21d851fc259f45c9982747102a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105410.json",
