    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3175a8e5c97dd1289055369c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想尽办法，借助秋川理事长的力量，\n才好不容易抵达赛场。\n而在那里等待的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "676476448e287d6c146b5498aaf3b35da5308aec420da8eb7c0a212400e039d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
