      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她在面对状况不佳的赛道时，却陷入了混乱。\n──在“GATE”之后，无法实现梦想。\n她喃喃地道出不祥的“预知”内容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e1d2f4de45d080d7a1651bacb36a663454ab189f8e6611eac22153432d0c81a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
